			},
			"date": "2025-12-12T15:10:51.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Overall? Worse. Faster to ship, cheaper to build, less care. Reused patterns everywhere, rushed delivery, and UX—especially on mobile—has become hostile by default.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
